# Workstream notes

- One note per workstream: `docs/workstreams/<slug>.md`, slug in lowercase kebab-case.
- Follow `docs/workstreams/_template.md`: the header list (Slug, Owner, Branches, MC tasks,
  SharePoint handoff), then every section in this order, even when one says "None": Goal,
  Status, Done, Next steps, Decisions and why, Open questions, Files / areas touched, How to run
  the tests, Blockers or dependencies on other workstreams, Last updated.
- Status is `active`, `blocked`, `paused` or `done`, with a date. Last updated starts with a
  YYYY-MM-DD date.
- Replace stale text instead of appending a diary. Git history keeps the old versions.
- Change the index row in `README.md` only when a workstream opens, closes or changes status.
- SharePoint `Agent Handoffs/` is the system of record. When it disagrees with a note, fix the
  note.
- Run `node scripts/workstream-note.mjs check` after editing.
